><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>≥</mo></mstyle></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>54</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mo>≥</mo></mstyle></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>6</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Now, we can cancel a common factor of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"37\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> from both the numerator and denominator.\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_cou